.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# NOTE: the brief's suggested pattern here (`data/synthetic/` etc. + `data/*/` + `!data/*/.gitkeep`)
# has a real gitignore bug: excluding a directory itself makes git never traverse into it, so a
# later `!data/*/.gitkeep` negation is silently ineffective and .gitkeep never gets tracked. Fixed
# below by excluding directory *contents* (`data/*/*`) instead of the directories themselves, with a
# wildcard negation for .gitkeep. See PHASE_REPORTS/phase0_environment.md. Generic across ANY
# data/<source>/ subdirectory (not just the three named in Section 4) on purpose -- Section 6a's real-
# data cascade added lending_club/ and elliptic/ beyond the two named example loaders, and a second
# gitignore gap here already let a 1.67GB CSV get staged once (caught before commit, see
# PHASE_REPORTS/phase5a_real_data_smoke_test.md) -- a generic pattern prevents a third recurrence for
# any future data source.
data/*/*
!data/*/.gitkeep
results/figures/*.png
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
logs/*.log

# Environment redirection (see PHASE_REPORTS/phase0_environment.md) —
# venv and data downloads live on E: drive, not in the repo tree, but
# keep these patterns too in case a local .venv/data is ever created.
.env
kaggle.json
